Propanal is not formed during the dry distillation of a mixture of calcium formate and calcium acetate.

$\begin{aligned}
(\mathrm{HCOO})_{2} \mathrm{Ca} \stackrel{\text{ Dry distillation }}{\longrightarrow} \mathrm{HCHO}&+\mathrm{CaCO}_{3}\\
\left(\mathrm{CH}_{3} \mathrm{COO}\right)_{2} \mathrm{Ca} \stackrel{\Delta}{\longrightarrow} \mathrm{CH}_{3} \mathrm{COCH}_{3}&+\mathrm{CaCO}_{3}\\
(\mathrm{HCOO})_{2} \mathrm{Ca}+\left(\mathrm{CH}_{3} \mathrm{COO}\right)_{2} \mathrm{Ca} \stackrel{\Delta}{\longrightarrow}& 2 \mathrm{CH}_{3} \mathrm{CHO} +2 \mathrm{CaCO}_{3}
\end{aligned}$
